n":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":17,"created_at":"2025-03-29T16:32:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T21:06:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10400F CPU @ 2.90GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nExpected behavior\nExported PackedScene references should persist after scene instantiation, enabling reliable scene transitions throughout runtime.\n\nActual behavior\nAfter scenes are instantiated, their PackedScene references become null in other scenes. Only first-time transitions to new scenes work.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create 3 scenes: scene1 (main), scene2, scene3\n2. In scene2/scene3, add `@export` vars for PackedScene references to other scenes\n3. Set up buttons with this code:\n       get_tree().change_scene_to_packed(target_scene)\n4. Run project from scene1\n5. Navigate scene1 → scene2 → scene1 (null reference)\n6. Navigate scene1 → scene2 → scene3 (works)\n7. From scene3 try returning to scene1/scene2 (both null)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[scene.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19522048/scene.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104769/reactions","total_count":27,"+1":27,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104769/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}